\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-NZ cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in Aug to curb kiwi dlr,  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  tumbles\b0\par\par\uc2 599 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 September 2014\par 06:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 * RBNZ data confirms it sold NZ$521 mln in August\par \par \uc2 * Biggest kiwi selling by RBNZ in three years\par \par \uc2 * Knocks already-battered kiwi to 1-year low (Adds detail, quotes)\par \par \uc2 By Gyles Beckford\par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, Sept 29 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets last month by selling a net NZ$521 million ($406.1 million), stoking speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may act again to capitalise on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slide.\par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar slumped to a one-year low after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  figures released on Monday confirmed the RBNZ had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the $4 trillion a day \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in August, its first major foray since April 2013.\par \par \uc2 The move underlined the RBNZ's discomfort with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength and comes days after governor \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2  renewed his warning that the 'kiwi' dollar was at unjustified and unsustainable levels.\par \par \uc2 The RBNZ has been ratcheting up its anti-kiwi rhetoric since July, and an analyst said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is acting at an opportune time when broad U.S. dollar strength had started to weigh on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The impact of its actions on markets has been more about sending a signal to markets that the RBNZ does see the recent strength of the NZD as unsustainable, helping to put downward pressure on the NZD at a time when the NZD was starting to retreat," said ASB Bank chief economist Nick Tuffley.\par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar, the 10th most traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  globally, tumbled to a low of $0.7748 from $0.7825.\par \par \uc2 The kiwi has fallen 12 percent since it touched a three-year high of $0.8839 in mid-July, hit by falling dairy prices, the RBNZ pausing its rate tightening, and market expectations the U.S. Federal Reserve is headed towards raising rates.\par \par \uc2 It was the biggest net sale of the New Zealand dollar since March 2011, when it sold NZ$525 million.\par \par \uc2 Before that it conducted full-blown selling in mid-2007 in an unsuccessful attempt to fight a rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and the RBNZ has long acknowledged it has limited resources to counter movements in the New Zealand dollar, which sees around $100 billion in daily turnover.\par \par \uc2 That dwarfs the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  war-chest of around $7.5 billion, according to RBNZ data.\par \par \uc2 Prime Minister elect \uc2 John Key\uc2 , a former \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer, said before the data was released that he backed the RBNZ's assessment of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and said it would have been "fairly logical" to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He said a reasonable "goldilocks" level for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was around $0.6500.\par \par \uc2 The RBNZ has not indicated its preferred level for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but Wheeler has said the kiwi's recent drop doesn't fully reflect the steep fall in the price of dairy products - the nation's biggest foreign export earner.\par \par \uc2 Last week, he renewed warnings about the unsustainable and unjustified level of the kiwi dollar, and said it was susceptible to a significant fall.\par \par \uc2 The RBNZ has said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be used when market conditions are opportune and it believed there was a good chance of influencing the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 "We don't rule out further tactical actions from the RBNZ to keep downward pressure on the NZD," Tuffley said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has always acknowledged that any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will work at the margins and look to smooth the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's movements.\par \par \uc2 ($1 = NZ$1.2830) (Additional reporting Naomi Tajitsu; Editing by Shri Navaratnam) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-9-29T05:02:27.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140929ea9t003mq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
