\par\par \b \uc2 New Zealand Dollar Up Late but Remains Rangebound\b0\par\par\uc2 By Lucy Craymer   \par \uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 2013\par 07:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON--The New Zealand dollar is slightly higher late Tuesday but remains rangebound as investors await the New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's meeting and U.S. retail sales data.\par \par \uc2 "The dust has settled after the [U.S.] nonfarm payrolls," said \uc2 Western Union\uc2  Business Solution Corporate Dealing Manager Chris Hunter. "The market is now looking for signs of further weakness in China and further strength in the U.S. dollar, and the Kiwi is just sitting there like a startled rabbit."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Hunter said the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems content to float between US$0.7800 and US$0.7900 for now.\par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar ended the day at US$0.7878 compared with US$0.7837 on Monday in New Zealand.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of New Zealand\uc2  is due to release it's three-monthly monetary policy statement on Thursday and make a cash rate decision. A Wall Street Journal poll of 12 economists unanimously sees the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  holding the cash rate at the record low 2.5% at Thursday's meeting, with a hike not expected until March 2014.\par \par \uc2 If there is more "jawboning" from RBNZ Governor Wheeler or if he hints that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar might again come under pressure, Mr. Hunter said.\par \par \uc2 New Zealand government bonds due April 2015 rose 2 basis points to 2.64% and April 2023 bonds rose 3.5 basis points to 3.635%.\par \par \uc2 Write to Lucy Craymer at lucy.craymer@wsj.com [ 11-06-13 0526GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1062 20711 4171   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130611e96b00047\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
