\par\par \b \uc2 DJ   \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Open to More  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rebecca Howard   \par \uc2 528 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2013\par 01:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Newswires English Content\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ruled out raising interest rates any time soon to curb spiralling house prices, and said it was prepared to sell more local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings to help rein in a soaring Kiwi that's hurting the nation's exporters.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of New Zealand\uc2  has held the benchmark cash rate at a record low 2.5% since March 2011 to help jump-start an economy battered by a series of devastating earthquakes in Christchurch, driving house prices to all-time high this year. It's also been grappling with an elevated Kiwi--up around 10% in the past year against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 --that's made it more difficult for companies in the mainly agriculture-exporting nation to compete globally.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been selling New Zealand dollars in recent months to help ease the pain felt by the country's exporters. In December, it sold nearly NZ$200 million in the biggest sale of New Zealand dollars it had undertaken in almost four years. The pace of its Kiwi selling has slowed this year, however, with only NZ$28 million sold in the first three months combined.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is scheduled to release its latest foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -transaction data later Thursday. Earlier this month, Mr. Wheeler confirmed the \uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  had sold more Kiwi holdings in April, without saying how much.\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  has been responding to the rising exchange rate through two avenues-- maintaining the official cash rate at an historically low level and through a degree of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gov. \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2  said in a speech Thursday. "We are prepared to scale up our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  activities if we see opportunities to have greater influence."\par \par \uc2 The Kiwi fell to US$0.8098 from US$0.8138 just before the governor spoke as traders factored in a higher likelihood of future \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  declines.\par \par \uc2 In his speech, the governor said the bank remained concerned over "risks" associated with the housing market as prices continued to track higher. While normally the bank would raise rates to dampen house prices, "this would carry significant risks of a further strengthening in the exchange rate," he said. The bank had other means to help bring down house prices such as tighter lending rules, said Mr. Wheeler.\par \par \uc2 He added that interest rates had more chance of staying lower for longer if house prices started to cool, and may even be cut if that happened while the exchange rate continued to rise.\par \par \uc2 New Zealand's home prices continue to hover near record highs, fueled also by growing demand for housing in the country's two largest cities, Auckland, where there is a rapidly expanding population, and Christchurch, where some 10,500 homes were destroyed in a series of earthquakes.\par \par \uc2 The latest data for April show house prices in Auckland jumped 13.3% on the year, while in the Canterbury-Westland region, where Christchurch is the major city, prices climbed 10%.\par \par \uc2 Write to Rebecca Howard at rebecca.howard@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 29-05-13 2322GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020130529e95t000oy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
