\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand \highlight\uc2  PM:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Doesn't Turn  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Direction\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rebecca Howard   \par \uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Mai 2013\par 08:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 --Prime Minister \uc2 John Key\uc2  said Monday the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the legal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but that he doesn't believe \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  turns the direction of a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar tumbled nearly a cent against the U.S. dollar last week after Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gov. \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2  confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and that it would do so again if needed to contain a soaring local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We've indicated on the record that we are prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange rate," Mr. Wheeler said in a testimony to lawmakers. "We would not expect, given the strength of the flows, that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would materially change the level of the exchange rate, but we could take potentially the tops off rallies. And in terms of activity, there has been some."\par \par \uc2 "They have always had the legal right to do that. They have done that before," Mr. Key said at a news conference Monday. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deemed it to be necessary under its rules then he supports its action, he said.\par \par \uc2 "But if you are asking me whether I believe \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  turns around the direction of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , then I stand by everything I have said. It definitely does not," said Mr. Key.\par \par \uc2 Write to Rebecca Howard at rebecca.howard@wsj.com [ 13-05-13 0618GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130513e95d000bi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
