\par\par \b \uc2 RPT- \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  COLUMN-RBNZ "peashooter" cannot keep the kiwi down\b0\par\par\uc2 550 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 2013\par 21:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Repeat)\par \par \uc2 -- Neal Kimberley is an \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market analyst for Reuters. The opinions expressed are his own --\par \par \uc2 By Neal Kimberley\par \par \uc2 LONDON, May 8 (Reuters)- The New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should savour the success of its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday to weaken its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , commonly known as the kiwi, against the U.S. dollar as it may be short-lived.\par \par \uc2 The arguments for the New Zealand dollar, which hit a 20-month high of $0.8676 in April, to remain strong against the greenback are compelling and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems unwilling to bet the farm to weaken it.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  confirmed on Wednesday selling the kiwi for only the second time since it was floated in 1985.\par \par \uc2 RBNZ Governor \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2  confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to a parliamentary committee but acknowledged the move was not likely to "materially change" the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Whether Wheeler would have revealed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  without being asked by the committee is unknowable.\par \par \uc2 Data from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's website indicates that previous bouts of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  have not been that substantial.\par \par \uc2 In November 2012 the RBNZ sold a net 64 million New Zealand dollars while in December it sold the princely amount of 199 million kiwi.\par \par \uc2 Set against the multi-billion daily size of the New Zealand dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market those volumes are peanuts, or perhaps more accurately peas.\par \par \uc2 "We'll be out in the war zone with a peashooter," said Finance Minister Bill English in February, playing down Wellington's will to curb the kiwi's strength.\par \par \uc2 "We have been pretty clear we are not willing to take the kind of huge risks involved in large scale speculation on the exchange rate with taxpayers' dollar," he said.\par \par \uc2 If the RBNZ is unwilling to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in strength, economic fundamentals still should underpin the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar.\par \par \uc2 Exports to China rose 32 percent in the 12 months to March as the world's second biggest economy displaced Australia as New Zealand's biggest export market.\par \par \uc2 And while some long-term investors see the commodity-linked kiwi, Australian and Canadian dollars declining due to economic slowdown in China, they say New Zealand's reliance on less cyclical agricultural exports may limit falls.\par \par \uc2 A surging housing market has triggered RBNZ warnings of inflation and financial stability risks that might even necessitate interest rate hikes from the current 2.5 percent record low.\par \par \uc2 And the $25 billion reconstruction of Christchurch following the 2011 earthquake remains a stimulus to the economy that should support the local dollar.\par \par \uc2 Asian central bankers looking to diversify the spread of their \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, and conscious of New Zealand's trade relationships with Asia, are likely to buy the kiwi on dips in its price.\par \par \uc2 In truth, Wednesday's RBNZ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have succeeded because the kiwi selling occurred when the broader \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was holding New Zealand dollars and had to adjust positioning.\par \par \uc2 However, with the arguments in favour of holding the kiwi still solid, the sell off might merely encourage new buyers.\par \par \uc2 Unless the New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared to swap its peashooter for a howitzer, the odds are that the kiwi bounces back from Wednesday's fall.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Nigel Stephenson)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 /NZD (COLUMN) (REPEAT) | ND | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130508e95800126\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (new zealand near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \t